OL,5,G1825 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe competition kicks off in
OL,7,     FInverness, where Dean and his
OL,8,     Fdaughter Chelsie reckon their
OL,9,     FB&B's premium location will pay
OL,10,     Fdividends.
OL,11,G1855 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FOn day two, can singer Marilyn and
OL,13,     Fher mum Agnes hit the high notes
OL,14,     Fat Bogenraith House in
OL,15,     FAberdeenshire?
OL,16,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,17,     FMost of the B&Bers are tickled
OL,18,     Fpink by the pods at Pamela's
OL,19,     FAberdeenshire glampsite - apart
OL,20,     Ffrom one pair, who aren't happy
OL,21,     Fglampers.
