OL,5,G1955 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FSharmin and Sarah host the week's
OL,7,     Ffinal visit at their expansive
OL,8,     F35-room hotel in Perth, where the
OL,9,     Fbreakfast setup confuses everyone.
OL,10,G2030 Four in a Bed
OL,11,     FIt's a feisty old payment day
OL,12,     Fafter a week packed to the gills
OL,13,     Fwith gripes. You could cut the
OL,14,     Ftension with a knife! Fortunately,
OL,15,     Fwe haven't given any of them
OL,16,     Fknives.
